---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Layout title="Demo" description="One grocery basket, three domains.">
  <h1>One grocery basket, three domains</h1>
  <p class="hook">One dairy item travels from the DC to the shelf and then to the till. Each stage is a domain from the series.</p>
  <section id="retail" class="stage">
    <h2>1. Retail: the shelf</h2>
    <p>A seeded week of store sales. The forecast sets a replenishment order, and on-shelf availability and shrink update as the week plays out.</p>
    <p><em>Coming in the next milestone. The interactive stage is not built yet.</em></p>
    <p><a href={`${base}retail/`}>Read the retail post</a></p>
  </section>
  <section id="logistics" class="stage">
    <h2>2. Logistics: the movement</h2>
    <p>The order moves from DC to store. OTIF and dock-to-stock time are calculated, and a delay can be injected.</p>
    <p><em>Coming in the next milestone. The interactive stage is not built yet.</em></p>
    <p><a href={`${base}logistics/`}>Read the logistics post</a></p>
  </section>
  <section id="payments" class="stage">
    <h2>3. Payments: the money</h2>
    <p>The customer pays by UPI or card at the till. Approval rate, decline reasons and settlement are shown.</p>
    <p><em>Coming in the next milestone. The interactive stage is not built yet.</em></p>
    <p><a href={`${base}payments/`}>Read the payments post</a></p>
  </section>
</Layout>
